<?xml version="1.0"?>
<odoo>
  <template id="vpn_download_password" name="VPN Download Password">
    <html>
      <head>
        <meta charset="utf-8"/>
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/>
        <title>VPN Download</title>
        <style>
          * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
          body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ede9fe 0%, #f4f6f9 60%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
          }
          .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(109,40,217,0.13), 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.07);
            padding: 2.5rem 2.2rem;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 400px;
          }
          .logo-wrap { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
          .logo-wrap img { max-width: 130px; height: auto; }
          h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e1b4b;
            margin-bottom: .4rem;
          }
          .subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 0.875rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
          }
          .badge-file {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: .5rem;
            background: #f5f3ff;
            border: 1px solid #ddd6fe;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: .55rem .9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
            font-size: .875rem;
            color: #5b21b6;
            font-weight: 500;
          }
          .badge-file svg { flex-shrink: 0; }
          .error-box {
            background: #fef2f2;
            border: 1px solid #fecaca;
            border-radius: 8px;
            color: #b91c1c;
            padding: .6rem .9rem;
            font-size: .875rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
          }
          label {
            display: block;
            font-size: .875rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #374151;
            margin-bottom: .4rem;
          }
          input[type="password"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: .65rem .9rem;
            border: 1.5px solid #d1d5db;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #111827;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color .2s, box-shadow .2s;
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
          }
          input[type="password"]:focus {
            border-color: #7c3aed;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(124,58,237,.15);
          }
          button[type="submit"] {
            width: 100%;
            padding: .7rem;
            background: #7c3aed;
            color: #fff;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background .2s;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: .5rem;
          }
          button[type="submit"]:hover { background: #6d28d9; }
          button[type="submit"].btn-tcp {
            margin-top: .6rem;
            background: #fff;
            color: #6d28d9;
            border: 1.5px solid #ddd6fe;
          }
          button[type="submit"].btn-tcp:hover { background: #f5f3ff; }
          .tcp-note {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: .78rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-top: .4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0;
          }
          .install-section {
            margin-top: 1.8rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            padding-top: 1.4rem;
          }
          .install-section h3 {
            font-size: .95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1e1b4b;
            margin-bottom: .8rem;
          }
          .install-section h4 {
            font-size: .85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #374151;
            margin-bottom: .3rem;
            margin-top: .9rem;
          }
          .install-section h4:first-of-type { margin-top: 0; }
          .install-section p {
            font-size: .8rem;
            color: #6b7280;
            margin-bottom: .3rem;
          }
          .install-section code {
            display: block;
            background: #f5f3ff;
            border: 1px solid #ddd6fe;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: .4rem .7rem;
            font-size: .78rem;
            color: #5b21b6;
            font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
            margin-top: .3rem;
            margin-bottom: .2rem;
            white-space: pre;
          }
        </style>
      </head>
      <body>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="logo-wrap">
            <img src="https://www.zebroo.de/web/image/website/1/logo/Zebroo?unique=05cd4b9" alt="Zebroo"/>
          </div>
          <h2>VPN Config Download</h2>
          <p class="subtitle">Enter the password to download your VPN configuration.</p>
          <t t-if="member_name">
            <div class="badge-file">
              <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 4H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h5l5 5v13a2 2 0 01-2 2z"/>
              </svg>
              <span t-esc="member_name + ('.sh' if is_script else '.conf')"/>
            </div>
          </t>
          <t t-if="error">
            <div class="error-box" t-esc="error"/>
          </t>
          <form method="post" t-attf-action="/download/byhash/vpn/#{hash}">
            <input type="hidden" name="csrf_token" t-att-value="request.csrf_token()"/>
            <label for="password">Password</label>
            <input type="password" id="password" name="password" autofocus="1" required="1" placeholder="Enter password"/>
            <button type="submit">
              <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 16v2a2 2 0 002 2h12a2 2 0 002-2v-2M7 10l5 5 5-5M12 15V3"/>
              </svg>
              <t t-if="is_script">Install-Script herunterladen (.sh)</t>
              <t t-else="">.conf-Datei herunterladen</t>
            </button>
            <t t-if="show_tcp">
              <button type="submit" name="config_type" value="tcp" class="btn-tcp"><svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.6 9h16.8M3.6 15h16.8M12 3a15 15 0 010 18M12 3a15 15 0 000 18"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg>
              .conf-Datei f&#xFC;r TCP/443 herunterladen
            </button>
              <p class="tcp-note">Langsamer, kommt aber durch Netze, die nur TCP 443 erlauben
                (Hotel, Gastnetz). Setzt voraus, dass der wstunnel-Client lokal l&#xE4;uft.</p>
            </t>
          </form>
          <div class="install-section">
            <h3>Installation Guide</h3>
            <t t-if="is_script and is_client_key_script">
              <h4>Linux / Server &amp; macOS</h4>
              <p>The download is an install <b>script</b> (not a .conf). It generates the WireGuard private key <b>locally on your machine</b> (the key never leaves your device), registers the public key and brings the tunnel up automatically. Save it and run as root:</p>
              <code>sudo bash <t t-esc="member_name + '.sh'"/></code>
              <p><b>Linux:</b> a Debian/Ubuntu-based host with root access.<br/>
              <b>macOS:</b> install <a href="https://brew.sh" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">Homebrew</a> first, then run the script &#x2014; it installs <code>wireguard-tools</code> via <code>brew</code> and configures the tunnel.</p>
              <p style="margin-top:.6rem;">&#x2139;&#xFE0F; Windows / iPhone are not supported by this script &#x2014; for those a ready-made <b>.conf</b> is needed instead; ask your administrator to switch your delivery mode.</p>
            </t>
            <t t-elif="is_script">
              <h4>Linux / Server</h4>
              <p>The download is an install <b>script</b> (not a .conf). Save it and run as root &#x2014; it installs WireGuard and brings the tunnel up automatically:</p>
              <code>sudo bash <t t-esc="member_name + '.sh'"/></code>
              <p>Requires a Debian/Ubuntu-based Linux host with root access.</p>
              <p style="margin-top:.6rem;">&#x26A0;&#xFE0F; This script only runs on Linux. For <b>macOS / Windows / iPhone</b> a ready-made <b>.conf</b> is needed instead &#x2014; ask your administrator to enable config delivery for your access.</p>
            </t>
            <t t-elif="is_wireguard">
              <h4>Linux / Server</h4>
              <p>You downloaded a ready-made <b>.conf</b>. Install WireGuard, copy the file into place and bring the tunnel up (run as root):</p>
              <code>sudo apt-get install -y wireguard wireguard-tools
sudo cp <t t-esc="member_name + '.conf'"/> /etc/wireguard/
sudo chmod 600 /etc/wireguard/<t t-esc="member_name + '.conf'"/>
sudo wg-quick up <t t-esc="member_name"/>
sudo systemctl enable wg-quick@<t t-esc="member_name"/></code>
              <h4>macOS</h4>
              <p>Install <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/wireguard/id1451685025" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">WireGuard</a> from the App Store &#x2192; <b>Import Tunnel(s) from File</b> &#x2192; select the downloaded .conf file &#x2192; <b>Activate</b>.</p>
              <h4>Windows</h4>
              <p>1. Download <a href="https://www.wireguard.com/install/" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">WireGuard for Windows</a>.<br/>
              2. Open WireGuard &#x2192; <b>Import tunnel(s) from file</b> &#x2192; select the downloaded .conf file &#x2192; <b>Activate</b>.</p>
              <h4>iPhone / iPad</h4>
              <p>Install the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/wireguard/id1451685025" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">WireGuard</a> app from the App Store &#x2192; tap <b>+</b> &#x2192; <b>Create from file or archive</b> &#x2192; select the downloaded .conf file &#x2192; enable the tunnel.</p>
            </t>
            <t t-else="">
              <h4>macOS</h4>
              <p>Install the <a href="https://apps.apple.com/app/wireguard/id1451685025" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">WireGuard</a> app from the App Store, open it and choose <b>Import Tunnel(s) from File</b>, then select the downloaded .conf file.</p>
              <h4>Linux</h4>
              <p>Install and activate the VPN tunnel:</p>
              <code>sudo apt-get install -y wireguard wireguard-tools
sudo cp myserver.conf /etc/wireguard/
sudo chmod 600 /etc/wireguard/myserver.conf
sudo wg-quick up myserver
sudo systemctl enable wg-quick@myserver</code>
              <h4>Windows</h4>
              <p>1. Download <a href="https://www.wireguard.com/install/" target="_blank" style="color:#7c3aed;">WireGuard for Windows</a>.<br/>
              2. Open WireGuard &#x2192; <b>Import tunnel(s) from file</b> &#x2192; select the downloaded .conf file &#x2192; <b>Activate</b>.</p>
            </t>
          </div>
        </div>
      </body>
    </html>
  </template>
</odoo>
